flowchart TD
  A[Reviewed commit] --> B[Checkout and toolchain]
  B --> C[Static and documentation checks]
  C --> D[Unit and contract tests]
  D --> E[Dependency and secret checks]
  E --> F{All required gates pass?}
  F -->|No| G[Fail workflow and fix]
  F -->|Yes| H[Build immutable artifact]
  H --> I[Deploy isolated staging]
  I --> J[Smoke and integration checks]
  J --> K{Release approved?}
  K -->|No| L[Stop and investigate]
  K -->|Yes| M[Canary production]
  M --> N[Observe latency, errors and saturation]
  N --> O{Healthy?}
  O -->|No| P[Rollback]
  O -->|Yes| Q[Complete rollout]
